        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3029-8x4.5, 8\" x 4-1/2\" Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n8\" x 4-1/2\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Mortise Type for use on <b>Hollow Metal Doors</b> (4-1/2\" Template Hole Pattern) - Door flange is mortised into edge of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 1-3/4\" thick. Packaged with 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTo find the proper size Bommer Double Acting Spring Hinge for your doors weight and width. use the charts here: <a href=\"/pages/bommer-double-acting-spring-hinge-selection\"><b>Bommer Spring Hinge Charts</b></a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bommer 3029-8x4.5 is the correct spring hinge when you are installing a <b>1-3/4\" thick metal door</b> that has <b>normal hinge locations</b> with a 4-1/2\" template pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3029-8x4.5 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Template Door Leaf (4-1/2\" Template Pattern)</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3029-8x45.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3029-8x4.5 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3029 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3029-8x4.5 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n<td>3029-8x4.5</td>\r\n<td>103 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>143 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/4\"</td>\r\n<td>7'-0\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Do Not use on Doors with Hinge Edge Beveled.</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 3029 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese Bommer hinges are available in other finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges). This item is Discontinued***</b>\r\n</p>",
